CVCompass

Apply anywhere. Stand out everywhere.

CVCompass is a Flask web application that automatically generates country-specific CVs as downloadable PDFs. Every country has different CV rules — CVCompass handles all of that automatically, so the user just fills in their details and downloads a professionally formatted CV in seconds.

The project is built using Python and Flask, following an Object Oriented Programming approach with five classes. It also integrates two AI features powered by the OpenAI API.

Live at: cvcompass.pythonanywhere.com


Features


Country-specific CV formatting for 6 countries — USA, UK, Netherlands, Germany, Japan and Australia
AI CV Reader — upload an existing CV and have all form fields filled in automatically using OpenAI
AI Profile Summary Generator — generate a unique, tailored professional summary based on your details and target country tone
Customisable sidebar colour and font style
Two column PDF layout with photo support for countries that require it
Dark mode toggle
Fully deployed and accessible online via PythonAnywhere



